<title>USA: Paxson to buy Landmark's Travel Channel.</title>
<headline>Paxson to buy Landmark's Travel Channel.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paxson Communications Corp said Monday that it has reached an agreement to acquire the programming, distribution and operations of U.S. Travel Channel from Landmark Communications Inc in a $75 million transaction.</p>
<p>The transaction includes $55 million in Paxson Communications common stock and $20 million in cash.</p>
<p>The Travel Channel is a 24 hour a day cable network serving about 20 million cable television subscribers with programs on travel and tourism.</p>
